# Coverage-profile exclusions: unanchored EREs, one per line, fed to `grep -v -f`
# by `make test`. Each entry drops packages that are tooling rather than product
# code, so the reported total measures what ships.
#
# No blank lines — an empty pattern matches every line, which makes grep discard
# the whole profile.
#
# testutil/    — shared test helpers; exercised only by the tests that call them.
# docs/skills/ — agent skill scripts; real packages in this module, so they are
#                built and linted, but they are not part of the binary.
testutil/
docs/skills/
